    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cătălauni</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cătĕlauni</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a tribe in</i> Gallia Belgica, near
			the mod. <i>Chālons-sur-Marne</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Eutr. 9, 13</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 11,
			10</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cătălaunĭcus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>at Catalauni</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clades,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Eum. Pan. Const. 4</span></i>
			.</div>
